Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.31,0:22:18.52,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&\blur12\t(0,264,\alpha&H00&\blur0)\t(4942,5210,\alpha&HFF&\blur12)}Once more unto the breach 心如国王
