Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.28,0:22:30.19,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&\blur12\t(0,284,\alpha&H00&\blur0)\t(5596,5910,\alpha&HFF&\blur12)}谁都没有见识过  完全自由的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.19,0:22:36.14,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&\blur12\t(0,207,\alpha&H00&\blur0)\t(5701,5950,\alpha&HFF&\blur12)}在那很高很远的地方 希望我能被选中
